			// But it's easier to think: dp[i][j] = max over k (number of buns of type i)
			// of (k * d[i] + dp[i-1][j - k*c[i]]) where k*b[i] <= a[i] and k*c[i] <= j
			// But wait, dp[i-1] already accounts for plain buns? No, dp[0] has plain buns.
			// Let me reconsider.

			// Better approach: dp[i][j] = max tugriks using stuffings 1..i and exactly j grams of dough.
